PT-44 v0.55 coupled audio/power - uncalibrated explicit parameters
* Factory topology: Philco p.38. Load resistors, field L and lamp hot R are test inputs.
* B-minus is the reference; no chassis bond. Rectifier is a single-point 3/2-power approximation.
VMAIN LINE 0 SIN(0 162.63455967290594 60)
VLINE_LINK LINE LINE_IN 0
R30_40 LINE_IN PLATE 40
RLAMP LINE_IN PLATE 42
R30_80 PLATE HEATER_IN 80
RHEATERS HEATER_IN 0 692.6666666666667
BRECT PLATE N_BPLUS_RECT I={1*0.0026189140043946205*max(V(PLATE,N_BPLUS_RECT),0)^1.5}
